# Winter, Cursed Rider: "Ward-Pay 2 life. Artifacts you control have 'Ward-Pay 2 life.'" (CR 702.21a, 613.1f). Turn 1 Bot1 casts Winter
# and an Ornithopter (an artifact creature, 0/2). On turn 2 Bot2 bolts Winter and declines the ward cost (Winter is untouched: ward is its
# own), bolts the Ornithopter and declines (it is untouched: the artifact has ward too), then bolts it again and pays 2 life (20 to 18),
# and the Bolt kills it. On turn 3 Bot1 bolts Bot2's own Ornithopter, which has no ward, so nothing is asked and it dies.

